message: "If you use this model or code in academic work, please cite this repository."
title: "Fluorestsentsiya-3B-Preview: a 3B Chinese narrative-writing model with a controllable old-translation register"
version: 0.1
date-released: 2026-11-05
license: other
license-url: "https://github.com/ktznl01/Fluorestsentsiya-3B-Preview/blob/main/LICENSE"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ktznl01/Fluorestsentsiya-3B-Preview"
authors:
  - name: "Fluorestsentsiya-3B-Preview contributors"
keywords:
  - large language model
  - Chinese narrative generation
  - LoRA
  - Qwen2.5
  - GGUF
  - stylometry
abstract: >-
  A rank-16 LoRA adapter on Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct that injects a controllable
  Chinese old-translation register for narrative writing, released as a PEFT
  adapter and a GGUF Q4_K_M checkpoint for llama.cpp. Evaluated with two-pass
  scoring on the Lech Mazur Creative Story-Writing Benchmark, a POLLUX-style
  criteria rubric, and Burrows's Delta stylometric fidelity.
